/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   app.tcss — GLOBAL SHEET (screen only; palette documented here)

   JIMMY PALETTE — used by every component stylesheet:

       bg      #0e0f13   canvas, near-black with a hint of blue
       surface #15161d   raised areas (input box)
       border  #23252e   hairlines
       text    #e8e9ee   primary text
       muted   #9a9daa   secondary text (user messages, labels)
       faint   #5f626b   hints, placeholders, meta
       accent  #b392f8   Jimmy violet — the ONE loud color
       danger  #f87171   errors only

   Rule of thumb: everything is grayscale except the accent, which
   marks "Jimmy" — brand, spinner, reply markers, focus ring.
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

Screen {
    background: #0e0f13;
    color: #e8e9ee;
}